WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.231
Mom: Today was a very scary day.

2
00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:12.417
Dad: Rachel might have been lost forever.

3
00:00:12.418 --> 00:00:15.288
Do you have anything to say, Ricky?

4
00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:20.819
Ricky: Mom told me to keep an eye on Rachel.

5
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.690
Dad: What happened?

6
00:00:22.691 --> 00:00:26.368
Ricky: I went to look at some games.

7
00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:30.364
I’m so sorry. Mom:

8
00:00:30.365 --> 00:00:35.023
Everyone makes mistakes, Ricky. I

9
00:00:35.024 --> 00:00:38.305
shouldn’t have left you alone. Rachel:

10
00:00:38.306 --> 00:00:42.474
I should have stayed with Ricky. Ricky:

11
00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:46.858
Next time, I will listen to you, Mom. Rachel:

12
00:00:46.859 --> 00:00:54.368
Me too. Ricky:

13
00:00:54.369 --> 00:00:58.581
I just wanted to say I’m glad you’re safe. Rachel:

14
00:00:58.582 --> 00:01:03.935
Me too, Ricky.

15
00:01:03.936 --> 00:01:06.884
Ricky: Hey, can I read that when you’re done?

16
00:01:06.885 --> 00:01:13.783
Rachel: No. Mom bought it for me.

